        {
          "part_id": "Hull_R92_Split_Front_Battery_Camera",
          "display_name": "Front hull \u2014 battery and camera",
          "file": "STL/Options/Hull_R92_Split_Front_Battery_Camera.stl",
          "material": "PETG",
          "quantity": 1
        }
      ],
      "components": [
        {
          "reference": "Epoxy from the two-part kit, for the hull joint",
          "quantity": "As needed",
          "scope": "HULL_SPLIT"
        }
      ],
      "fasteners": [
        {
          "reference": "M3 heat-set insert, OD4 mm, length 6 mm",
          "quantity": 11
        },
        {
          "reference": "Split hull only: M4 \u00d7 15 socket-head screw",
          "quantity": 6,
          "scope": "HULL_SPLIT"
        },
        {
          "reference": "Split hull only: M4 hex nut, 7 mm across flats",
          "quantity": 6,
          "scope": "HULL_SPLIT"
        },
        {
          "reference": "Split hull only: M4 washer, \u00d89 \u00d7 0.8 mm",
          "quantity": 6,
          "scope": "HULL_SPLIT"
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        "Choose the one-piece hull or both split halves. For the split hull, dry-fit both halves first, then apply a thin layer of two-part epoxy to the mating faces. Engage the locating pins, seat six nuts from the battery side, and fit six M4 \u00d7 15 screws with washers from the motor/computer side. Tighten progressively and let the epoxy cure before installing electronics or the battery.",
        "Use a soldering iron to fit the inserts: place each insert over its hole, heat it with the iron tip, then gently press it straight into the plastic. Fit four inserts for the cover, four for the arm plate and two for the LiDAR base in the hull.",
        "Use the same soldering-iron method to fit the remaining insert in the LiDAR base for the carriage lock. Keep the threads clear and let all inserts cool before fitting screws."
      ],
      "video": null,
      "image": "images/split-hull-r92.jpg",
      "image_alt": "Current R92 split hull, motor/computer half and battery/camera half"
    },
